00:12:46.631 --> 00:12:49.561
Yes, clap for the wunderschöne
ladies. Sie sind so schön, na?

00:12:50.221 --> 00:12:54.121
Look at Betsy!
She is just the live of every party.

00:13:03.081 --> 00:13:05.851
Sabrina Kern
besucht ihre Familie in Zürich.

00:13:06.581 --> 00:13:10.331
Mutter Sissi und Vater Nicolas
betreiben mehrere Restaurants.

00:13:11.001 --> 00:13:13.691
Eines der Lokale
führt Sabrinas Schwester Melanie.

00:13:16.811 --> 00:13:19.731
Unsere Familie
